# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Humble Beginnings (399): taken in Stormwind on the way in, the compass at the
# Alexston Farmstead on the west loop, handed in on the Stormwind visit before the boat. Humans
# take Thor's flight to Stormwind on the first Sentinel Hill visit for Continue to Stormwind (6281),
# Dungar Longdrink (6261) and Return to Lewis (6285), and hand Elmore's Task (1097) to Grimand
# Elmore before the boat. Business in Auberdine (97894) is taken from Borgus Steelhand on that visit.
# Added 2026-11-07 (Alliance 12-20 zone order): east Elwynn for Dwarves and Gnomes, on the walk from
# Goldshire to Westfall at about 13.5-14.5 (Humans do it in their start guide; Night Elves and Skyborne
# arrive at 14.5, where its level 9-10 quests turn grey before the loop ends): A Fishy Peril (40,
# Further Concerns needs it), Guard Thomas' chain, the Eastvale Logging Camp, the Tower of Azora and
# the Jasperlode Mine in one loop; Report to Gryan Stoutmantle (109) comes from Dughan on the way in.
# Left out for them: The Jasperlode Mine (76) and Westbrook's chain (239, 11), which need The Fargodeep
# Mine (62) first (players' recordings: never offered without it), and Delicate Instruments' second
# part (91724), a second trip to Stone Cairn Lake for one hand-in at the tower.
# Alba Fairmoon's Toxic Soil chain (92742 to 92748) is for every Alliance race, Humans included: players'
# recordings show Humans taking and handing it in (2026-11-08), so #144's Human exclusion is lifted.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East Elwynn (Dwarves and Gnomes)

step Goldshire
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip On the road from Stormwind to Westfall, Goldshire is the first stop: Remy "Two Times" stands outside the inn, Marshal Dughan beside him. Remy's A Fishy Peril goes straight to Dughan, who then gives Further Concerns; his Report to Gryan Stoutmantle goes with you to Westfall.
  accept 40                                   -- Remy "Two Times"
  turnin 40                                   -- Marshal Dughan
  accept 35
  accept 109                                  -- Marshal Dughan: for Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill

