# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The road in: the Jansen Stead and Saldean's

step The Jansen Stead
  zone Westfall
  tip Follow the road from Elwynn into Westfall: the Furlbrows sit by their burned farm, the first one on the road. Pick up oats from any Sack of Oats you pass on the loop: the rest are gathered in the fields here on the way back.
  accept 109 npc 237 only Human -- Farmer Furlbrow; Humans took it from Deputy Rainer in Elwynn

