  tip Young Goretusks root in the fields along the road south from Saldean's to Sentinel Hill: take their snouts on the way.
  collect 731 quest 38.3                      -- Goretusk Snout

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Sentinel Hill

step Sentinel Hill's tower and Thor
  only Human
  tip Gryan Stoutmantle and Captain Danuvin stand at the top of the stone tower, Quartermaster Lewis inside it, Thor the gryphon master on the south side of the hill with Scout Galiaan beside him. Thor gives you Lewis' note for Osric Strang with a free flight to Stormwind: take it now. In Stormwind, Morgan Pestle's shop is in the Trade District by the gryphons, Osric's shop, Limited Immunity, in Old Town; Baros Alexston stands in Cathedral Square on the way back to Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master.
  turnin 109                                  -- Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 12
  accept 102                                  -- Captain Danuvin
  accept 6181                                 -- Quartermaster Lewis, inside
  getfp "Sentinel Hill"
  accept 153                                  -- Scout Galiaan, beside Thor
  turnin 6181                                 -- Thor
  accept 6281                                 -- Thor: the free flight he offers goes to Stormwind
  fly "Stormwind"

