step Molsen Farm's Harvest Watchers
  tip Harvest Watchers and Golems work the fields around Molsen Farm; they drop the isosprings, gyrostabilizers, Okra and sometimes a Precessive Autocognition Assembly. Foe Reaper 4000, a level 20 rare, walks here: leave it alone.
  kill 114 quest 9                            -- Harvest Watchers
  collect 255007 quest 92909.1
  collect 255010 quest 92909.2
