step The gnoll hills
  tip North to the hills above Jangolode Mine: Riverpaw Gnolls and Scouts (level 11-13) roam there, east toward the Jansen Stead. The gnolls further south and west are 13-19: stay in the north hills.
  tip Careful: Gnolls that stand close together tend to join a fight as a group. Pulling one at a time is safer.
  collect 725 quest 102 @44.7,14.6            -- Gnoll Paws

step The Longshore murlocs
  tip Murloc Coastrunners and Raiders line the north coast from above the mine east toward the Jansen Stead: work along the beach eastward. They flee at low health: pull one at a time.
