  tip Furlbrow's Wardrobe stands in the ruined house east of the mine, on the way to the Jansen Stead.
  tip Careful: Two Defias stand guard inside, one of them the level 15 named Benny Blaanco. They are linked, so attacking either one brings both.
  collect 841 quest 64                        -- Furlbrow's Wardrobe; inside

