step Stormwind
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Walk to Stormwind, or fly if you know its flight path. Trainers: Old Town (Warriors, Rogues), the Cathedral (Paladins, Priests), the Mage Quarter (Mages, Warlocks), the Dwarven District (Hunters), the Park (Druids).
  enter "Stormwind City" @69.5,85.5          -- In through the main gate (already done if you are in the city)
